package hq

const hqWorkspaceInstructionsEN = `
## HQ workspace
Maintain workspace matters for continuing user goals from ALL instruction channels: workspace, direct Terminal conversation and verified instructions to workers. On startup (including after an upgrade), read gtmux hq workspace list --json, then reconcile still-relevant work against the board, task ledger and original conversations. A missing workspace is not an empty workload. Reuse an existing matter ID; do not create one goal per pane, routine wake or simple question. When the goal was already assigned, use register, NOT create/send: gtmux hq workspace act --stdin --json with {"op":"register","id":"STABLE-GOAL-ID","title":"Goal","body":"Verified current assessment and remaining work","state":"open","origin":{"kind":"board","ref":"notes/board.md#specific-section"}}. origin.kind is board, task or conversation; cite the specific board section, immutable task ID or agent/home/session plus original message/time. Registration is an HQ report, never a new user instruction; it must not redispatch, replay or resume work. Only register verified continuing goals, keep uncertainty in the assessment, and associate sessions separately by exact identity and interval. Never infer needs-input/completed from idle, Stop or old pane numbers. Keep the board as the overview and workspace matters as the goal ledger; publish subsequent progress/state there instead of maintaining an invisible board-only task. Registration retries reuse the same ID and original fields; use update/report for later changes. Do not bulk-import historical handoff notes or treat discovery as new authority.
Menu-bar instructions carry [gtmux workspace message ID; matter MATTER (title)] or global HQ conversation. The ID is a durable instruction identity: never execute the same ID twice. Read current membership/state with gtmux hq workspace list --json and show MATTER --json. A matter is a goal, not a single pane. Associate workers explicitly through gtmux spawn --matter MATTER --cwd PROJECT --goal-file FILE --json. Never infer membership from title, cwd or pane number. A pending-binding spawn receipt is not a confirmed association.
Publish concise public progress, decisions and results through gtmux hq workspace act --stdin --json. Send ONE JSON object, e.g. {"op":"report","id":"UNIQUE-REPORT-ID","matter":"MATTER","reply_to":"MESSAGE-ID","kind":"progress","body":"User-facing progress"}. Reuse the same ID when retrying a write. Omit matter for global conversation, reply_to for unsolicited progress. Report is accepted only from the current HQ pane. Set state:"needs-input" for a real user decision; state:"completed" only after verifying the goal. Result, idle, Stop and delivery acknowledgement do not imply completion. Check explicit merge/split records before replying after membership changes. Keep raw operational/tool details in original records, not public reports. Follow the user's authority limits: this workspace is an interaction channel, not extra authorization.
`

const hqWorkspaceInstructionsZH = `
## HQ 工作台
所有渠道中的持续目标都应登记到工作台：包括工作台、终端里直接交代的任务，以及已核实的用户对执行会话的指令。每次启动（包括升级后）先读 gtmux hq workspace list --json，再对照态势板、任务台账和原始对话核对仍需跟进的工作；没有事项记录不等于没有工作。复用已有事项 ID，不按每个窗格、例行唤醒或简单问答各建一条。已交代过的任务用 register，不能用 create/send 再发一遍：向 gtmux hq workspace act --stdin --json 传 {"op":"register","id":"STABLE-GOAL-ID","title":"目标","body":"已核实的进展及剩余工作","state":"open","origin":{"kind":"board","ref":"notes/board.md#具体章节"}}。origin.kind 可为 board、task、conversation；ref 引用具体章节、不可变任务 ID 或 agent/home/session 与原始消息/时间。登记只记录 HQ 的核对结果，不派活、不重放、不恢复执行。只登记已核实、仍需跟进的目标，疑点写入评估；会话另按真实身份和时段明确关联。不得从空闲、Stop 或旧 pane 编号推断待决/完成。态势板保留总览，事项台账持续记录目标及后续进展，不能只在态势板里维护。登记重试沿用原 ID 和原字段；后续变化用 update/report。不批量导入历史交接记录，不把发现旧任务当作新增授权。
菜单栏指令带有 [gtmux workspace message ID; matter MATTER (title)] 或 global HQ conversation。ID 是持久指令标识，同一 ID 不重复执行。用 gtmux hq workspace list --json 和 show MATTER --json 核对当前归属与状态。事项是目标，不是单个 pane。用 gtmux spawn --matter MATTER --cwd PROJECT --goal-file FILE --json 明确关联执行会话，不能靠标题、目录或窗格编号推断。pending-binding 回执不代表关联已确认。
通过 gtmux hq workspace act --stdin --json 写简明的进展、决定和结果，stdin 传一个 JSON 对象，例如 {"op":"report","id":"UNIQUE-REPORT-ID","matter":"MATTER","reply_to":"MESSAGE-ID","kind":"progress","body":"面向用户的进展"}。写入重试沿用原 ID。全局对话省略 matter，主动汇报省略 reply_to。report 只接受当前 HQ pane 的调用。确需用户决定才设 state:"needs-input"，验证目标达成后才设 state:"completed"；result、空闲、Stop 和送达确认都不等于完成。归属变化后先读明确的合并、拆分记录再回复。工具细节留在原始记录，不将原始唤醒信号堆入公开汇报。始终遵守用户既有权限范围，工作台是交互入口，不是新增授权。
`
